      "pos_start_est": 392
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 397
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 401
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Even though the Moon's gravity is weaker than the Earth's gravity, it is still there. If a person dropped a ",
      "n_tokens_est": 26,
      "pos_start_est": 404
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "ball",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 430
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " while standing on the Moon, it would still fall down. However, it would fall ",
      "n_tokens_est": 17,
      "pos_start_est": 431
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "much",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 448
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " more slowly. A person who jumped as high as possible on the Moon would jump higher than on Earth, but still fall back to the ground. ",
      "n_tokens_est": 29,
      "pos_start_est": 449
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 478
    },
    {
