      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 521
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Without an atmosphere, the Moon's environment is not protected from heat or cold. ",
      "n_tokens_est": 17,
      "pos_start_est": 524
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Astronauts",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 541
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " wore ",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 542
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "spacesuits",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 543
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " to survive and carried ",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 544
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "oxygen",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 548
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " to breathe. These suits weighed about as much as the astronauts (though they were not as heavy as on Earth because of the Moon's weak gravity). The astronauts never took their ",
      "n_tokens_est": 37,
      "pos_start_est": 549
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "gloves",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 586
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " or spacesuits off on the Moon.",
      "n_tokens_est": 7,
      "pos_start_est": 587
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 594
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 598
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "On the Earth, the ",
      "n_tokens_est": 5,
      "pos_start_est": 601
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "sky",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 606
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " is ",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 607
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "blue",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 608
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " because the Sun's blue ",
      "n_tokens_est": 6,
      "pos_start_est": 609
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "rays",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 615
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " bounce off the ",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 616
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "gases",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 619
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " in the ",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 620
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "atmosphere",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 622
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ". This makes it look like ",
      "n_tokens_est": 6,
      "pos_start_est": 623
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "blue",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 629
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "light",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 630
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " is coming from the sky. On the Moon, there is no atmosphere for light to bounce off. This means the sky looks black, even in the ",
      "n_tokens_est": 30,
      "pos_start_est": 631
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "daytime",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 661
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ".",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 662
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 663
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 667
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Earth's atmosphere causes most ",
      "n_tokens_est": 6,
      "pos_start_est": 670
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "meteorites",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 676
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " (space rocks) to burn up. The Moon does not have this protection. Meteorites crash into it and create wide, shallow holes called ",
      "n_tokens_est": 27,
      "pos_start_est": 677
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "craters",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 704
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ". The Moon has thousands of them. Newer craters overlie older ones.",
      "n_tokens_est": 14,
      "pos_start_est": 705
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 719
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<h3>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 723
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Water",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 726
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</h3>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 727
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 731
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "In 2009 ",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 734
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Chandrayaan-1",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 736
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ", India's first lunar exploration mission, found a lot of water on the Moon. However, the water is not liquid; it is in the form of ",
      "n_tokens_est": 32,
      "pos_start_est": 739
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "hydrates",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 771
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " and ",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 772
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "hydroxides",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 773
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ". Liquid water cannot exist on the Moon because ",
      "n_tokens_est": 9,
      "pos_start_est": 774
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "photodissociation",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 783
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " quickly breaks down the ",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 784
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "molecules",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 788
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ". However, based on the data received from Chandrayaan-1, liquid surface water may have once existed on the Moon.",
      "n_tokens_est": 24,
      "pos_start_est": 789
    },
    {
      "node_id": 3,
      "seq_id": 2,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 813
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<h2>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 817
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Phases",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 820
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</h2>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 821
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 825
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Because the Moon is round, half of it is lit up by the ",
      "n_tokens_est": 14,
      "pos_start_est": 828
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Sun",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 842
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ". As it goes around (or orbits) the Earth, sometimes the side that people on Earth can see is all lit brightly. Other times only a small part of the side we see is lit. ",
      "n_tokens_est": 40,
      "pos_start_est": 843
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 883
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 887
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "This is because the Moon does not send out its own light. People only see the parts that are being lit the eclipse by the ",
      "n_tokens_est": 26,
      "pos_start_est": 890
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "sunlight",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 916
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ". These different stages are called ",
      "n_tokens_est": 6,
      "pos_start_est": 917
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Phases of the Moon",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 923
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ".",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 927
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 928
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 932
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "It takes the Moon about a month (29 days, 12",
      "n_tokens_est": 12,
      "pos_start_est": 935
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "hours, and 44",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 947
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "minutes) to complete the ",
      "n_tokens_est": 5,
      "pos_start_est": 951
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "cycle",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 956
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ", from big and bright to small and dim and back to big and bright. People throughout history have used the Moon's cycles to measure time.",
      "n_tokens_est": 30,
      "pos_start_est": 957
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 987
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 991
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "The phases of the Moon are, in order:",
      "n_tokens_est": 10,
      "pos_start_est": 994
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1004
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<ol>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1008
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1011
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "The \"new Moon\" (when the Moon passes between the Earth and Sun)",
      "n_tokens_est": 16,
      "pos_start_est": 1014
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1030
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1034
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "The \"waxing crescent\"",
      "n_tokens_est": 5,
      "pos_start_est": 1037
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1042
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1046
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "The \"first quarter\"",
      "n_tokens_est": 5,
      "pos_start_est": 1049
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1054
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1058
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "The \"waxing gibbous\"",
      "n_tokens_est": 5,
      "pos_start_est": 1061
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1066
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1070
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "A \"full Moon\" (when the Moon and Sun are on opposite sides of the Earth)",
      "n_tokens_est": 19,
      "pos_start_est": 1073
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1092
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1096
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "The \"waning gibbous\"",
      "n_tokens_est": 5,
      "pos_start_est": 1099
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1104
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1108
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "The \"third quarter\"",
      "n_tokens_est": 5,
      "pos_start_est": 1111
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1116
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1120
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "The \"waning crescent\",",
      "n_tokens_est": 6,
      "pos_start_est": 1123
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1129
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1133
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "A new Moon again",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1136
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</li>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1140
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</ol>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1144
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1148
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Each of the four middle phases of the Moon lasts about seven days on average (around 7.38 days). This time can change by about ±11% because the Moon moves closer to or farther from Earth from its farthest point (apogee) to its closest point (perigee).",
      "n_tokens_est": 57,
      "pos_start_est": 1151
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1208
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1212
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "The number of days since the last new moon is called the Moon’s age.",
      "n_tokens_est": 17,
      "pos_start_est": 1215
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " A full set of moon phases is called a lunation.",
      "n_tokens_est": 11,
      "pos_start_est": 1232
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1243
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1247
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "To find the Moon’s age and phase for any date, you can count how many days have passed since a known new moon (for example, January 1, 1900, or August 11, 1999). Then divide that number by the average length of a moon month (29.53059 days).",
      "n_tokens_est": 61,
      "pos_start_est": 1250
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " The number left over after dividing is the Moon’s age.",
      "n_tokens_est": 13,
      "pos_start_est": 1311
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1324
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1328
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "This simple method is good for general or fun uses, like moon phase clocks. It is not exact because it does not use the real shape of the Moon’s orbit or the exact time of the new moon, so it can be off by a few hours. The farther you go from the reference date, the less accurate it becomes.",
      "n_tokens_est": 68,
      "pos_start_est": 1331
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1399
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1403
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " Because the Moon wobbles a little as it orbits Earth (a motion called libration), we can sometimes see a tiny bit more than the full moon (up to about 101%) or a small part of its far side (up to 5%).",
      "n_tokens_est": 51,
      "pos_start_est": 1406
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1457
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<h3>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1461
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Tidal locking",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 1464
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</h3>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 1466
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1470
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "The Moon always shows the same side to Earth. ",
      "n_tokens_est": 10,
      "pos_start_est": 1473
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Astronomers",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 1483
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " call this phenomenon ",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 1484
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "tidal locking",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 1487
    }
